{"v":4,"catch":"追求完美的賽車線路，留下滾滾濃煙！","desc":"《Pocket Drift Rally》是一款節奏快、卡通風格的賽車遊戲。玩家將在狹窄的彎道中滑行，掌握漂移技巧，並在受真實賽車賽道啟發的動態瀝青跑道上競技。憑藉鮮艷的畫面、誇張的動作和迷人的拉力賽車主角，遊戲提供了快速、爽快的漂移體驗，非常適合短時間、刺激的遊玩。自定義你的駕駛風格，追求完美的賽車線路，在統治每個賽道的同時留下滾滾濃煙！","publisher":"Gametry","release":"2026-03-05","genres":["街機","競速"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3348a8ec82bdf09a91fa22a87c79c9842cce53f7f8ccaeac82af577daed0a2ee.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/804022295807a9caf05c6fc0c41967d7b4dbaae1504c2fc3fc1a3450301b134c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/6d9125b79a09bf16613d79d4928c3de9408d98d5a5733dc3aa1dedae20a29eb4.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3f449cc3d36dc751549d372c205d2447651cd81083ae31c88fc6ae9f191693b0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4d300ffd6ea65d3864f8cf1db27ed57533b58effc01cc3665179b10c273a96ce.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/9183833ff9c7c6b445f58a3ccb5c92a2591ad5751b64cb05053165b31292682e.jpg"],"titleId":"010024102673a000","dlc":[]}